	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0801_boy2_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きもち　わるい……▼
だけど　おいらは　トレーナー！
ふなよいに　まけずに　たたかうぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:51:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>気持ち　悪い……▼
だけど　おいらは　トレーナー！
船酔いに　負けずに　戦うぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:51:49" />
